    "description": {
      "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--2\"><p><em>護甲（中甲），非普通（需同調）</em><br />穿着這套護甲期間，你可以用其施展法術<em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack-zh-tw.new-icon.Item.o9GQEt4fYw6WjpB0]{死者交談 Speak with Dead}</em>或是<em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack-zh-tw.new-icon.Item.xYpJGRI4xcMa41kO]{活化死屍 Animate Dead}</em>。以此施展了法術後，直到次日黎明爲止這套護甲都無法再次被用於施展這兩個法術。<br />這套盔甲會隨着你靈魂的離去而消逝。若你在同調這套護甲期間死亡，這套護甲也將隨之摧毀。</p><div class=\"WordSection1\"><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE:char;MARGIN:2pt 0cm 10pt\"><span class=\"GramE\">該護甲</span>主要由皮條固定的金屬護胸組成。儘管它並沒有爲四肢提供額外的防護，但其在保證着裝者活動自由度的同時，爲其生命器官提供了十分有效的保護效果。</p></div></div><p>While wearing this armor, you can use it to cast either @spell[Speak with Dead] or @spell[Animate Dead]. Once the armor has cast a spell in this way, it can't cast either spell until the next dawn.</p><p>Your soul keeps this armor together. If you die while you are attuned to the armor, the armor is destroyed.</p><p>This armor consists of a fitted metal chest piece worn with supple leather. Although it leaves the legs and arms relatively unprotected, this armor provides good protection for the wearer's vital organs while leaving the wearer relatively unencumbered.</p></div>",
